'''Growing Blue''' (進化の青マタタビ, ''Shinka no Ao Matabi'', '''Evolution Blue Actinidia''') was the [[Catfruit]] gathering daily event of Thursday. By clearing any of these stages, you might get a Blue Catfruit, a Blue Seed or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] and replaced with [[Growing Catfruit]] in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

